        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "6pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ],
        [
          "text-indent",
          "22.5pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "We have always been committed to building helpful products that can improve the lives of millions of people worldwide. Our product innovations are what make our services widely used, and our brand one of the most recognized in the world. Google Services' core products and platforms include ads, Android, Chrome, devices, Gmail, Google Drive, Google Gemini, Google Maps, Google Photos, Google Play, Search, and YouTube, with broad and growing adoption by users around the world.",
      "text_hash": "7bd7f443cbee4325873c6cb0afa19d968c25e274613d5131e7735d3192ffc627",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
