    {
      "block_id": "block-000088-778b3180",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[95]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 88,
      "reported_page": 5,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "'arial',sans-serif"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "font-weight",
          "400"
        ],
        [
          "line-height",
          "120%"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "6pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ],
        [
          "text-indent",
          "22.5pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "Our products and services have come a long way since the company was founded more than 25 years ago. While Google Search started as a way to find web pages, organized into ten blue links, we have driven technical advancements and product innovations that have transformed Google Search into a dynamic, multimodal experience. Large language models have made it possible to express more natural language queries, vastly improving the types of questions users can ask, and the quality of results. For example, AI Overviews makes it easier to ask Google anything and get a helpful response. AI Mode allows users to ask more nuanced questions that might have previously taken multiple searches, using Gemini’s advanced reasoning, thinking, and multimodal capabilities.",
      "text_hash": "778b3180e1d3e2ae55cbb71f6cbc741761b62618871bf62effbdc29206be5acb",
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "block_id": "block-000089-eec5429f",
      "dom_path": "/html/body/div[96]",
      "image_asset_id": null,
      "layout_role": null,
      "ordinal": 89,
      "reported_page": 5,
      "source_anchor": "i6be430fe3ebf411481dcec8b0abe9149_19",
      "style_signature": [
        [
          "font-family",
          "'arial',sans-serif"
        ],
        [
          "font-size",
          "10pt"
        ],
        [
          "font-weight",
          "400"
        ],
        [
          "line-height",
          "120%"
        ],
        [
          "margin-top",
          "6pt"
        ],
        [
          "text-align",
          "justify"
        ],
        [
          "text-indent",
          "22.5pt"
        ]
      ],
      "table": null,
      "text": "This drive to make information more accessible and helpful has led us over the years to improve the discovery and creation of digital content both on the web and through platforms like Google Play and YouTube. People are consuming many forms of digital content, including watching long and short form videos and podcasts, streaming TV, playing games, listening to music, reading books, and using apps. Working with content creators and partners, we continue to build new ways for people around the world to create and find great digital content.",
      "text_hash": "eec5429fd49f68bb1fe17a36a52b337b53f6d847c72bf7186d3d0348afbc435a",
      "type": "paragraph"
    }
  ],
